  "$comment": "Cross-language SSoT for a partner giveaway (POST /v1/giveaways). Statuses, the terminal set and the transitions; the public winner delivery states, entrant statuses and filter reasons, the reasons a giveaway.cancelled event carries, the reversal row states and kinds; and the giveaway.* webhook event types (giveaway.entries only for a giveaway created with entries_events: true). Unknown future values must be tolerated, never rejected.",
